-04-02T16:35:08Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "2. In the original script, Y did not exist. It didn’t exist in the source material either. When it was added to the script later, the character only had about six lines and no name, which is why X was reluctant to take up the role. He had recently been cut from another film and feared the same would happen again. X's wife told him to stop overthinking and take it. The surname Y eventually given to the character was borrowed from Danny Y, a real FBI counter-terror operative. A first name was not assigned until four years and three films later.\nY was subsequently written into the source material too, initially appearing under the callsign \"Cheese\".\nID X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:35:35Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Ocean", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:35:38Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Danny Ocean", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:36:07Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Coulson?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:36:18Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Phil Coulson is Y", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:36:39Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Arey naam kyu nahi aa raha", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-02T16:36:49Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Gregg?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]